### [JORGE] PATCH que deja el glamping para 10 personas -> 422
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/alojamientos/{{idGlamping}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacidad": 10
}

### [JORGE] PATCH con un precio negativo -> 400
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/alojamientos/{{idGlamping}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "precioNoche": -5
}

